    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "TOM MAHER & COMPANY SCSI RICS IPAV - This 2 bed, first-floor apartment is the perfect STARTER HOME or INVESTMENT OPPORTUNITY as MARKET RENT IS ACHIEVABLE. The property is complete with WEST-FACING Balcony which enjoys the evening sun, designated car space. The apartment offers bright, light-filled spacious accommodation, while in need of a little updating a wealth of opportunity awaits the discerning purchaser to create their on dream home with style and flair.  There is NO ONWARD CHAIN. Enviably located in this ever-popular exclusive gated development just in off the Kiltipper Road, circa 10-15 minute walk to The Square, The Luas, The Hospital and a wide range of services and amenities, The N81, M50 via Tallaght or Firhouse are within a short distance. Early viewing is strongly advised as there is strong demand for this style of property. REGISTER YOUR INTEREST BY EMAIL."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "The apartment is accessed via the walkway to the side. Main door entrance to hall, only 6 units in the Block.\r\nFIRST FLOOR\r\nLobby shared by 2 apartments\r\nOwn door access to hallway, shelved storage unit & separate hot press. \r\nLounge / Dining room : 2.95m x 5.66m \r\nKitchen/Breakfast room : 3.54m 2.92m Oak-effect kitchen units and presses, integrated extractor fan, tiled splash area, French doors lead to the WEST-facing balcony finished with slate. \r\nMain Bedroom : 5.06m x 2.83m Built-in wardrobes, wood flooring. En-suite: 1.78m x 1.62m Tiled shower cubicle - pedestal whb - wc - tiled flooring\r\nBathroom : 1.85m x 1.72m Bath, tiled splash area, pedestal whb - wc."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "PVC double glazing\r\nElectric heating \r\nTrip switch fuse board\r\nBoth bedrooms have built- in wardrobes\r\nMain bedroom  En-suite \r\nWEST FACING Balcony, slate finish, a wonderful sun trap \r\nAmple storage space\r\nDesignated parking\r\nBin stores\r\nQualitas Mgt Company\r\nService charge circa €TBC"
      },
